      <title>亚马逊无人机配送扩张至近500城，物流新阶段开启</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260819/%E4%BA%9A%E9%A9%AC%E9%80%8A%E6%97%A0%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%BA%E9%85%8D%E9%80%81%E6%89%A9%E5%BC%A0%E8%87%B3%E8%BF%91500%E5%9F%8E%E7%89%A9%E6%B5%81%E6%96%B0%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E5%BC%80%E5%90%AF/</link>
